# Golden files for the VT suites are byte-exact recordings of terminal streams. They carry
# real CR LF pairs as data, so Git must never normalise their line endings: doing so
# rewrites the recording and the round-trip tests fail on the next checkout.
*.golden -text

# The branding kit is pinned by SHA-256 in CHECKSUMS.sha256; any rewrite breaks the icons job.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
